<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update -Pakistan- Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update -Pakistan- Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Oct 28 - Vessels waiting off port, one general cargo, waiting for four days. Three containers, the first waiting for three days. Two tankers, the first waiting for two days. There are six other vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
